window.MG_LAZY_DATA["data/lazy/resources/comm-v28-127-dbacb7a02ce36872.json"]={sha256:"dbacb7a02ce368728b03d4fa6f42fe5b226c8f6a9c62a916c4339fee7501667e",value:{"sources":[{"id":"v28-case-d07d59cf08269924","url":"https://www.ses.com/o3b-mpower","title":"O3b mPOWER","titleEn":"O3b mPOWER","publisher":"SES","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"media":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-127","videos":[],"guides":[]}]},"related":{"courses":[{"courseId":"comm-v28-127","related":[{"id":"comm-v28-128","referenceUrls":["https://www.gps.gov/gps-and-telling-time"],"title":"GPS 授時：奈秒偏移如何變成距離誤差","titleEn":"GPS timing: converting nanoseconds to range error","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付物能重現 106.666666667 ms propagation RTT 與 160 ms propagation RTT，保留失敗情境且每個通過判定有明確門檻；需分開列出模型未涵蓋的實際系統驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The artifacts must reproduce 106.666666667 ms propagation RTT and 160 ms propagation RTT, preserve failing scenarios and attach a threshold to each pass decision; list actual-system validation outside this model separately.","difference":"能推導並解釋2.99792458 m pseudorange bias與29.9792458 m pseudorange bias，建立gps_clock.csv、共同時鐘欄、偽距殘差，並完成以下驗收：5 m單項距離預算僅10 ns例通過；不等於整體GPS定位誤差小於5 m。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 2.99792458 m pseudorange bias and 29.9792458 m pseudorange bias; create gps_clock.csv, common-clock column and pseudorange residuals; apply this acceptance decision: Only10 ns meets a5 m single-term budget; that does not establish total GPS position error below5 m.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["從原理 中軌系統以較少換手與較長距離形成不同設計取捨；延遲需用斜距而非只按LEO/MEO標籤排序。 展開基準式 4*8000/300000*1000；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：以單段延遲乘四重算，另列處理與地面段為待測量；總時間不能小於傳播下界。 將兩條推導一起存入 meo_budget.csv、四段斜距、待測延遲帳本。","從原理 未校正時間偏差dt產生偽距偏差c*dt；同一接收器時鐘偏差是共同未知量，不能各衛星任意刪除。 展開基準式 299792458*10/1000000000；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：由距離除c還原10/100 ns；四衛星解算需共同位置三維加時鐘四未知量。 將兩條推導一起存入 gps_clock.csv、共同時鐘欄、偽距殘差。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Starting from MEO creates a tradeoff between handovers and distance; delay needs slant range rather than orbit labels alone., expand baseline expression 4*8000/300000*1000; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Multiply per-leg delay by four and list processing/terrestrial segments as unmeasured; total cannot fall below propagation. Save both derivations with meo_budget.csv, four slant ranges and unmeasured-delay ledger.","Starting from Uncorrected timing biasdt creates pseudorange biasc*dt; a receiver clock bias is a shared unknown rather than an arbitrary per-satellite subtraction., expand baseline expression 299792458*10/1000000000; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Divide range bias byc to recover10/100 ns; four-satellite positioning includes three position unknowns plus one clock term. Save both derivations with gps_clock.csv, common-clock column and pseudorange residuals.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]},{"id":"comm-v28-137","referenceUrls":["https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-451-principles-of-digital-communication-ii-spring-2005/"],"title":"CCSDS 卷積碼：Viterbi 狀態與運算預算","titleEn":"CCSDS convolutional coding: Viterbi states and computation","why":"用兩課的可觀察驗收條件比較模型邊界：交付物能重現 106.666666667 ms propagation RTT 與 160 ms propagation RTT，保留失敗情境且每個通過判定有明確門檻；需分開列出模型未涵蓋的實際系統驗證。","whyEn":"Compare model boundaries using observable acceptance criteria: The artifacts must reproduce 106.666666667 ms propagation RTT and 160 ms propagation RTT, preserve failing scenarios and attach a threshold to each pass decision; list actual-system validation outside this model separately.","difference":"能推導並解釋64 trellis states與256 trellis states，建立viterbi_states.csv、狀態枚舉與分支計數、運算/記憶體分帳，並完成以下驗收：假設每區塊20萬分支評估預算，K7通過而K9不通過；實際碼選擇還須BER與延遲證據。","differenceEn":"Derive and explain 64 trellis states and 256 trellis states; create viterbi_states.csv, state/branch enumeration and separate compute/memory budgets; apply this acceptance decision: For an assumed200000 branch evaluations per block, K7 passes and K9 fails; an actual code choice also needs BER and latency evidence.","transfer":"保留單位與邊界條件，僅轉移可證明相容的驗證方法。","transferEn":"Retain units and boundary conditions; transfer only demonstrably compatible verification methods.","practice":["從原理 中軌系統以較少換手與較長距離形成不同設計取捨；延遲需用斜距而非只按LEO/MEO標籤排序。 展開基準式 4*8000/300000*1000；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：以單段延遲乘四重算，另列處理與地面段為待測量；總時間不能小於傳播下界。 將兩條推導一起存入 meo_budget.csv、四段斜距、待測延遲帳本。","從原理 二元輸入、記憶m=K-1的卷積碼共有2^m狀態；此計數描述trellis，不自行保證任何碼的距離或解碼品質。 展開基準式 2**(7-1)；逐步記錄中間量與單位，先手算再用計算器或Python重算。接著用不同表示法交叉檢查：枚舉6或8個記憶bit的所有位元字；每狀態兩個輸出分支，單步分支128或512，區塊再乘1000。 將兩條推導一起存入 viterbi_states.csv、狀態枚舉與分支計數、運算/記憶體分帳。","比較兩個模型的輸入、誤差與驗收條件，記錄不能沿用的假設。"],"practiceEn":["Starting from MEO creates a tradeoff between handovers and distance; delay needs slant range rather than orbit labels alone., expand baseline expression 4*8000/300000*1000; record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Multiply per-leg delay by four and list processing/terrestrial segments as unmeasured; total cannot fall below propagation. Save both derivations with meo_budget.csv, four slant ranges and unmeasured-delay ledger.","Starting from A binary-input convolutional code with memory m=K-1 has2^m states; this describes its trellis, not a guaranteed distance or decoding performance., expand baseline expression 2**(7-1); record intermediate values and units, calculate manually, then repeat with a calculator or Python. Use this independent representation: Enumerate all6- or8-memory-bit words; two outgoing branches per state give128 or512 branches per step, multiplied by1000 per block. Save both derivations with viterbi_states.csv, state/branch enumeration and separate compute/memory budgets.","Compare inputs, errors, and criteria; document assumptions that cannot be transferred."]}],"references":[{"id":"v28-case-d668d1868ebc37f5","url":"https://www.gps.gov/gps-and-telling-time","title":"GPS and Telling Time","titleEn":"GPS and Telling Time","publisher":"GPS.gov","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."},{"id":"v28-case-a5af92c580a30715","url":"https://ocw.mit.edu/courses/6-451-principles-of-digital-communication-ii-spring-2005/","title":"Principles of Digital Communication II","titleEn":"Principles of Digital Communication II","publisher":"MIT OpenCourseWare","scope":"查證具名案例與原理背景。課內數值、故障資料與判準為原創教學假設；請勿當作廠商規格或操作程序。","scopeEn":"Establish named case and principle context. Numbers, fault data, and criteria are original teaching assumptions, not manufacturer specifications or operating procedures."}],"overview":"比較相鄰案例與另一組案例的模型、可量測結果及可轉移的驗證方法。","overviewEn":"Compare neighboring and cross-group cases by model, measurable outcome, and transferable verification method."}]},"places":{"courses":[]},"vendors":{"courses":[],"vendors":[]}}};
